        <p>I am a Senior Business Analyst at i-exceed Technology Solutions, a company that provides digital banking solutions. My role is techno-functional: I help the business articulate its needs and the rationale for change, then design and describe solutions that deliver value.</p>
        <p>Before this I worked at State Bank of India, the largest public sector bank in India, as a Trade Finance Officer, Credit Manager, Relationship Manager for SME and Probationary Officer, among other roles. That work gave me depth in trade finance, foreign exchange operations, SME credit and retail assets credit. I also coordinated the branch's audit by the Reserve Bank of India.</p>
